  "note": "REQ-0219 -- four synergy engines, one per pack, each distinct from the live packs. DEEP TIDE: a Chill engine at sea -- sahuagin/giant_crab/kraken APPLY Chill (cold_current, barnacle_grip, abyssal_grip), sea_serpent CONVERTS it via the ACTIVE bonus_vs_status verb x mult (tidal_fang); kraken is the boss. PETRIFYING COURT: a Stun engine -- medusa/cockatrice gaze APPLY Stun (petrifying_glare, petri_peck), stone_golem CONVERTS it (seismic_fist); lamia adds lifesteal + Weakness. GREENSKIN WARBAND: swarm tempo + heal_ally sustain (goblin_shaman crude_mending, the batch-005 dark_mending precedent) + Weakness convert (orc_warrior brutal_cleave). TITAN RIDGE: big hits + a Chill engine (frost_giant winters_call applies, glacial_axe converts); behemoth is the boss. multi_strike follows REQ-0203 bone_breath semantics: n=[lo,hi] per hit x hits (each sub-hit a separate on-hit event). Attack profiles follow ruling 7 typing (batch-002/005/006 conventions); aoe_statuses is only authored with aoe>=1 so it is never inert. heal_ally carries an empty edge (no ray at the player field), per REQ-0203.",
